OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785781107
OL,3,CMan who dumped animal carcasses
OL,4,Coutside village churches detained
OL,5,Cindefinitely
OL,7,FA man has been detained indefinitely
OL,8,Ffor dumping animal carcasses outside
OL,9,Fvillage churches across Hampshire.
OL,11,FBenjamin Lewis, of Totton,
OL,12,FSouthampton, previously pleaded guilty
OL,13,Fto five counts of religiously
OL,14,Faggravated harassment and two counts
OL,15,Fof theft of lambs between February and
OL,16,FAugust 2025.
OL,18,FHe's been detained under the Mental
OL,19,FHealth Act.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
