FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785781107
OL,3,CMan who dumped animal carcasses
OL,4,Coutside village churches detained
OL,5,Cindefinitely
OL,7,FSentencing the 48-year-old, who
OL,8,Fappeared by videolink at Southampton
OL,9,FCrown Court, to be detained in
OL,10,Fhospital with restrictions, Judge
OL,11,FWilliam Mousley KC said: "These
OL,12,Foffences taken together would
OL,13,Fotherwise have justified substantial
OL,14,Fsentences of imprisonment."
OL,16,FLaura Deuxberry, prosecuting, told the
OL,17,Fcourt that lambs had been stolen from
OL,18,Ftwo small farms in the local Hampshire
OL,19,Farea.
OL,26,@sD@ZOUvD@[O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/10
