FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785781107
OL,3,CMan who dumped animal carcasses
OL,4,Coutside village churches detained
OL,5,Cindefinitely
OL,7,FLewis had killed them before dumping
OL,8,Ftheir bodies at four churches as well
OL,9,Fas at a mental health facility where
OL,10,Fhe had previously been treated.
OL,12,FShe said that in February 2025, a
OL,13,Fdeer's head was found with an inverted
OL,14,Fwooden cross at St Theresa's Church in
OL,15,FTotton followed by a lamb being placed
OL,16,Fon a light fixture below a statue of
OL,17,FMary along with another inverted cross.
OL,19,FMs Deuxberry said that children had
OL,20,Fseen the dead lamb and been "very
OL,21,Fdistressed as a result".
OL,26,@|D@]OU}D@WO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
