PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785781107
OL,3,CMan who dumped animal carcasses
OL,4,Coutside village churches detained
OL,5,Cindefinitely
OL,7,FShe added that Canon Treloar told
OL,8,Fpolice that he believed the
OL,9,Fperpetrator had targeted the church
OL,10,Fduring the Easter period and he felt
OL,11,F"targeted and disturbed".
OL,13,FAt Christ Church in Emery Down, Lewis
OL,14,Falso dumped a deer without a head on
OL,15,Fone date in February followed on a
OL,16,Flater date by a deer's head being
OL,17,Fplaced in the church's pulpit on top
OL,18,Fof a cross which had been moved from
OL,19,Fthe altar.
OL,26,@sD@AOUsD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
