OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785781107
OL,3,CMan who dumped animal carcasses
OL,4,Coutside village churches detained
OL,5,Cindefinitely
OL,7,FLewis also targeted St Peter's Church
OL,8,Fin Bramshaw, where a dead lamb was
OL,9,Fplaced on flagpole with a tarot card
OL,10,Fnext to it and a deer's head was
OL,11,Fplaced on a pew on a later date.
OL,13,FAt Christ's Church in Colbury, a lamb
OL,14,Fwas placed on a tree stump with an
OL,15,Finverted stone cross next to it, Ms
OL,16,FDeuxberry said.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
