OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785781107
OL,3,CMan who dumped animal carcasses
OL,4,Coutside village churches detained
OL,5,Cindefinitely
OL,7,FThe prosecutor said a deer's head with
OL,8,Fan inverted cross was put on the gates
OL,9,Fof the Anchor House mental health
OL,10,Ffacility in Totton where Lewis had
OL,11,Fpreviously been treated.
OL,13,FMs Deuxberry said there had been a
OL,14,Fnumber of previous incidents dating
OL,15,Fback five years that the prosecution
OL,16,Fwere not pursuing. Lewis was also
OL,17,Fconvicted of religious harassment in
OL,18,F2003 in the first case of its kind in
OL,19,Fthe country.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
