OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785781107
OL,3,CMan who dumped animal carcasses
OL,4,Coutside village churches detained
OL,5,Cindefinitely
OL,7,FThe prosecutor said that when Lewis
OL,8,Fwas arrested deer blood was found in
OL,9,Fthe boot of his car, and when his home
OL,10,Fwas searched by police, officers found
OL,11,Fsatanic symbols and ritual notes as
OL,12,Fwell as sketches of vampires and
OL,13,F"concerning books about vampires and
OL,14,Fhow best to kill humans".
OL,16,FA suitcase containing inverted crosses
OL,17,Fand images was also found.
OL,26,@uD@AOUvD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
