OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785781107
OL,3,CMan who dumped animal carcasses
OL,4,Coutside village churches detained
OL,5,Cindefinitely
OL,7,FMs Deuxberry said the members of the
OL,8,Fpublic who had found the dead animal
OL,9,Fparts had been "distressed and
OL,10,Fdisturbed", and the owner of some of
OL,11,Fthe stolen lambs had considered moving
OL,12,Ffrom her farm where she had lived all
OL,13,Fof her life.
OL,15,FShe said by targeting churches, Lewis
OL,16,Fhad caused upset to congregations and
OL,17,Fadded: "It's meant to be a place of
OL,18,Fsanctuary but unfortunately these
OL,19,Fincidents caused them to be fearful of
OL,20,Fgoing to their sanctuaries."
OL,26,@qD@POUrD@JO]yD@HOU|D@\O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
