OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785781107
OL,3,CMan who dumped animal carcasses
OL,4,Coutside village churches detained
OL,5,Cindefinitely
OL,7,FConsultant forensic psychiatrist Dr
OL,8,FGauruv Malhan told the court that
OL,9,FLewis had been diagnosed with severe
OL,10,Fautism and obsessive-compulsive
OL,11,Fdisorder as well as mixed personality
OL,12,Fdisorder and a mild learning
OL,13,Fdisability. He said Lewis had
OL,14,F"fantastical thinking patterns" and
OL,15,Fhad "limited insight" into his
OL,16,Fcondition.
OL,18,FHe added that his autism dated from
OL,19,Fbirth and at the age of 13 had placed
OL,20,Fa dead frog on a cross inside a church.
OL,26,@vD@AOUvD@_O]wD@EOUwD@UO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/10
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
