OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785781107
OL,3,CMan who dumped animal carcasses
OL,4,Coutside village churches detained
OL,5,Cindefinitely
OL,7,FAndrew Price, defending, said: "He is
OL,8,Fvery sorry and wants it to be known
OL,9,Fand clear that he recognises that he
OL,10,Fhas done wrong, that he recognises the
OL,11,Fsituation and circumstances of the
OL,12,Fvictims."
OL,14,FLewis told the court after he was
OL,15,Fsentenced: "I want to just apologise
OL,16,Fto the victims because they said they
OL,17,Fwere worried about me if I was to come
OL,18,Fout, I do not want people to worry
OL,19,Fabout me."
OL,26,@oD@`OUtD@IO]wD@LOU{D@JO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/10
